  "chunks": [
    {
      "chunk_type": "isnad",
      "arabic_text": "وَعَنْهُ عَنْ أَبِيهِ عَنْ جَمِيلٍ عَنْ أَبِي عَبْدِ اللَّهِ عَلَيْهِ السَّلَام قَالَ: قَالَ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ صَلَّى اللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَآلِهِ وَسَلَّمَ: «إِنَّ اللَّهَ تَبَارَكَ وَتَعَالَى لَمَّا خَلَقَ آدَمَ عَلَيْهِ السَّلَام نَظَرَ إِلَيْهِ فَاسْتَنْشَقَ مِنْ رُوحِهِ فَخَرَجَ مِنْهُ مَا خَرَجَ»",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And he (Al-Shaykh) narrated from his father from Jamil from Abu Abdillah (peace be upon him) who said: The Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him and his family) said: \"Indeed, when Allah, the Exalted, created Adam (peace be upon him), He looked at him and inhaled from his spirit, so that which came out came out from it.\""
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "فَقَالَ اللَّهُ تَبَارَكَ وَتَعَالَى: «وَجَعَلْنَا مِنْهُمْ أَئِمَّةً يَهْدُونَ بِأَمْرِنَا لَمَّا أُوْمِنُوا بِرَبِّهِمْ»",
      "translations": {
        "en": "So Allah, the Exalted, said: \"And We made from among them leaders guiding by Our command when they were patient and were certain of Our signs.\" (Note: The hadith often quotes Surah As-Sajdah 32:24 or similar, but here it refers to the creation of Imams from his progeny/spirit)."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "أَيْ: جَعَلَ مِنْ صُلْبِهِ أَئِمَّةً يَهْدُونَ بِأَمْرِهِ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Meaning: He made from his loins (progeny) leaders who guide by His command."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَقَالَ: «وَجَعَلْنَا مِنْهُمْ أَئِمَّةً»",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And He said: \"And We made from among them leaders...\""
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "أَيْ: مِنَ الْأَنْبِيَاءِ",
        "translations": {
        "en": "Meaning: From the Prophets."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَقَالَ: «يَهْدُونَ بِأَمْرِنَا»",
        "translations": {
        "en": "And He said: \"...guiding by Our command.\""
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "أَيْ: بِأَمْرِنَا",
        "translations": {
        "en": "Meaning: By Our command."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَقَالَ: «لَمَّا أُوْمِنُوا»",
        "translations": {
        "en": "And He said: \"When they were patient...\""
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "أَيْ: صَبَرُوا",
        "translations": {
        "en": "Meaning: They were patient."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَقَالَ: «بِرَبِّهِمْ»",
        "translations": {
        "en": "And He said: \"...and were certain of Our signs.\" (Note: The text often continues with 'bi-ayatina' but here focuses on 'bi-Rabbihim' or similar variations in Kamal al-Din)."
      }
    },
